  id: RiverFord
  displayName: Ford
  description: 'Stepping stones on a gravel bar across the shallows. Reaches 1 tile
    out from each bank: enough for a narrow river. Drag out a straight line over
    the water; everyone can walk over it, raiders too, and they wear it down as they
    cross. Boats can''t pass it.'
